[0.016, "o", "Build a web API for splitting expenses. Users create groups and add members. Any member can record an expense with a payer, amount, description, and the members it's split equally between. Provide an endpoint showing each member's net balance in the group, and a settle-up endpoint suggesting the minimum transfers to clear all debts. Money calculations must be exact, with no rounding errors. Include automated tests.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[7m%\u001b[27m\u001b[1m\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                                                     \r \r"]
