[0.001, "o", "eat]-api-splitit-group-expense-splitting.md\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m     \u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[2m  1 \u001b[22m# Splitit — Group Expense Splitting Web API\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[2m2\u001b[10G\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[2m3\u001b[10G\u001b[22m## Requirements\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m5\u001b[10G\u001b[22mImpl\u001b[15Gment a small HTTP JSON API that lets a group of people record shared expenses and know, exactly and at any moment, who owes whom — and the fewest\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m \u001b[10G\u001b[22m payments\u001b[20Gthat would settle\u001b[38Geverything.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[2m6\u001b[10G\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[2m7\u001b[10G\u001b[22m- Create groups and add group-scoped members to them.\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m9\u001b[12G\u001b[22mExpos\u001b[19Geach member's net balance within a gr\u001b[57Gup.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[2m10\u001b[12G\u001b[22mSuggest the\u001b[24Gprovably\u001b[33Gminimum \u001b[42Gumber of transfers that clears all debts in a group (exact for groups up to 16 non-zero balances; best-effort beyond, \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  \u001b[10G\u001b[22mand th\u001b[17G response s\u001b[29Gys wh\u001b[35Gch).\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m… +527 lines \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m⏺\u001b[3G\u001b[39mTightening\u001b[14Gtwo\u001b[18Gwordings\u001b[27G(complexity\u001b[39Gnote\u001b[44Gand\u001b[48Gthe\u001b[52GDP\u001b[55Greconstruction\u001b[70Gstep)\u001b[76Gso\u001b[79Gthey're\u001b[87Gunambiguous\u001b[99Gfor\u001b[103Ggeneration.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m⏺\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning\u001b[11G\u001b[1m1\u001b[13G\u001b[22mshell\u001b[19Gcommand…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cd /Users/maya/Workspace/sdd-bake-off/frameworks/openspdd/spdd/prompt && python3 - <<'EOF'\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bimport glob\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mp=glob.glob('*\u001b[21Gplitit*')[0]\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153ms=open(p).read()\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153ma=\"exact settlement is O(3ⁿ)-free subset DP of O(2ⁿ · n) with n ≤ 16 non-zero balances (≈1M steps worst case)\"\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bb=\"exact settlement is a subset DP o…\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✢\u001b[3GActioning… \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(running PreToolUse hook · 2m 35s · ↓\u001b[52G17.4k tokens)\r\u001b[1B  ⎿  Tip: Use /btw to ask a quick side question without interrupting "]
